                    Bat->>Bat: Run player controls or ai()
                    Bat->>Keyboard: Read movement keys
                    Keyboard-->>Bat: Movement state
                    Bat->>Bat: Clamp Y position and select sprite
                    Game->>Ball: update()
                    Ball->>Ball: Move through speed-based substeps

                    alt Ball collides with a bat
                        Ball->>Bat: Check bat position
                        Bat-->>Ball: Collision position
                        Ball->>Ball: Reverse dx and adjust dy
                        Ball->>Ball: Normalize direction vector
                        Ball->>Impact: Create bounce impact
                        Impact-->>Game: Append impact effect
