                        Ball->>Impact: Create wall impact
                        Impact-->>Game: Append impact effect
                        Ball->>Game: play_sound("bounce", count)
                        Game-)Audio: Play bounce sound
                        Ball->>Game: play_sound("bounce_synth")
                        Game-)Audio: Play synthesizer sound
