                    Loop->>Loop: Set state to GAME_OVER
                else Match continues
                    Loop->>Game: update()
                    Game->>Bat: Update both bats
                    Game->>Ball: Update ball
                    Game->>Impact: Update active impacts

                    alt Ball leaves left or right screen edge
                        Game->>Ball: out()
